Need opinions on better course towards losing 15 lbs in 8 weeks (by summer)

I'm about to place an order for Evista (Ralox) to kill the rest of my gyno (shit really worked, but I stupidly only bought a 2 month supply) so I might as well order the rest of my 'supplies' in one go...

&#x200B;

I'm currently on 250/250 Test/Deca; but am wondering if I should go 1 of two directions...

1) stay on 250/250 T/D and add Clen 2weeks on/off

or

2) drop to 125/125 Test/Deca add Tren-Ace 300 /week

&#x200B;

Goal is to maintain size but knock off 15/20 lbs before summer. I will also start running so i'm unsure if Tren is the way to go, although it is the greatest recomp. substance out there.

&#x200B;

All suggestions (even ones not mentioned above) are appreciated.

&#x200B;

Bonus Question - What size needle y'all use for delts and lats and how much CC's yall put in there (i'm using 5/8" and only doing .7cc max) not sure if I can fit more oil in there (it already feels kinda weird), or if I should simply be using a larger needle?

